xt\",\"text\":\"**Configuring JetServiceTest network isolation**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Verifying Hazelcast Jet native image compatibility**\"}]}"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_iAjcC9JW6BieDGwJprDVCJ9r|fc_09b567d65264bcd7016ac4a175e01c87d0bfa2416a11ebff1e", "name": "write", "arguments": {"path": "tests/src/com.hazelcast/hazelcast/5.5.0/src/test/java/com_hazelcast/hazelcast/JetServiceTest.java", "content": "/*\n * Copyright and related rights waived via CC0\n *\n * You should have received a copy of the CC0 legalcode along with this\n * work. If not, see <http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>.\n */\npackage com_hazelcast.hazelcast;\n\nimport com.hazelcast.config.Config;\nimport com.hazelcast.config.MapConfig;\nimport com.hazelcast.core.Hazelcast;\nimport com.hazelcast.core.HazelcastInstance;\nimport com.hazelcast.jet.Job;\nimport com.hazelcast.jet.pipeline.Pipeline;\nimport com.hazelcast.jet.pipeline.Sinks;\nimport com.hazelcast.jet.pipeline.Sources;\nimport com.hazelcast.map.IMap;\nimport org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;\n\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;\n\nimport static org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat;\n\npublic class JetServiceTest {\n    @Test\n    void copiesDistributedMapWithBatchPipeline() throws Exception {\n        Config config = new Config();\n        config.setClusterName(\"jet-pipeline-test\");\n        config.getNetworkConfig().setPort(0);\n        config.getNetworkConfig().getJoin().getAutoDetectionConfig().setEnabled(false);\n        config.getNetworkConfig().getJoin().getMulticastConfig().setEnabled(false);\n        config.getNetworkConfig().getJoin().getTcpIpConfig().setEnabled(false);\n        config.getJetConfig().setEnabled(true);\n        config.addMapConfig(new MapConfig(\"jet-source\").setBackupCount(0));\n        config.addMapConfig(new MapConfig(\"jet-target\").setBackupCount(0));\n\n        HazelcastInstance instance = Hazelcast.newHazelcastInstance(config);\n        try {\n            IMap<String, Integer> source = instance.getMap(\"jet-source\");\n            IMap<String, Integer> target = instance.getMap(\"jet-target\");\n            source.putAll(Map.of(\"one\", 1, \"two\", 2, \"three\", 3));\n\n            Pipeline pipeline = Pipeline.create();\n            pipeline.readFrom(Sources.map(source)).writeTo(Sinks.map(target));\n            Job job = instance.getJet().newJob(pipeline);\n            job.getFuture().get(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n\n            assertThat(target).containsExactlyInAnyOrderEntriesOf(source);\n        } finally {\n            instance.shutdown();\n        }\n    }\n}\n"}}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 1030, "output": 939, "cacheRead": 100864, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 343, "totalTokens": 102833, "cost": {"input": 0.0041199999999999995, "output": 0.01878, "cacheRead": 0.0403456, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0632456}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1791271277877, "responseId": "resp_09b567d65264bcd7016ac4a16e53b087d0af8921c556da2c8f", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": [{"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_iAjcC9JW6BieDGwJprDVCJ9r|fc_09b567d65264bcd7016ac4a175e01c87d0bfa2416a11ebff1e", "toolName": "write", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Successfully wrote to tests/src/com.hazelcast/hazelcast/5.5.0/src/test/java/com_hazelcast/hazelcast/JetServiceTest.java"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791271296215}]}
